Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 11:27:16 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 156/220] [ae-patch] Fold a request-phase approval card's code
 under Show details

A request-phase ask (the rabbit-hole check, the slot cap) gates the message the
person just sent, and its card already says why it stopped; the JSON under that
sentence repeats the message and is noise most of the time. The code now sits
behind a Show details toggle, closed by default, linked to it for screen readers.
Every other phase shows what the agent is about to do (a tool call's command, a
response), so its code stays in view, whoever wrote the policy.
